---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { protectedRun, separateControl, receipt } from '../showcases/native-tool-boundary/content';
---
<section class="native-boundary wrap" id="small-example" aria-labelledby="native-boundary-title" data-native-boundary>
  <div class="native-intro">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Recorded runtime check</p><h2 id="native-boundary-title">The grant survives<br /><em>a restart.</em></h2></div>
    <p>The protected thread could use <code>exec_command</code>. After the app-server restarted, that same thread still could not use <code>apply_patch</code>. A separate control granted the patch tool and created its expected file.</p>
  </div>
  <p class="native-scope">Actual patched Codex app-server · scripted upstream messages · synthetic model/account fixtures · no real model inference.</p>
  <p class="native-shell-note"><strong>A shell grant, with its full reach.</strong> <code>exec_command</code> is a broad shell tool. The harmless read shown here does not make it a read-only filesystem permission.</p>
  <div class="native-protected" aria-label="One protected thread, before and after restart">
    <article class="native-read" data-native-read>
      <p class="native-step">01 / Selected tool executes</p>
      <h3>Grant <code>{protectedRun.exactGrant}</code></h3>
      <p class="native-field-label">Actual command on a fictional fixture</p>
      <code class="native-command">{protectedRun.read.command}</code>
      <pre aria-label="Actual recorded read output">{protectedRun.read.output}</pre>
      <p class="native-verdict"><Icon name="check" /> Exit code {protectedRun.read.exitCode} <span>Fixture unchanged</span></p>
    </article>
    <article class="native-resume" data-native-resume>
      <p class="native-step">02 / App-server restarts</p>
      <h3>Same saved thread.<br />New app-server process.</h3>
      <p>The engine’s <code>start_or_resume_thread</code> path reloads the protected thread after the app-server stops.</p>
      <dl><div><dt>Grant after resume</dt><dd><code>{protectedRun.resume.exactGrantAfter}</code></dd></div><div><dt>Engine policy record</dt><dd>Unchanged</dd></div><div><dt>Runtime ceiling</dt><dd>Unchanged</dd></div></dl>
      <p class="native-small">One app-server restart; the Engine process itself was not restarted.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <div class="native-comparison">
    <article class="native-denied" data-native-denied>
      <p class="native-step">03 / Protected thread after resume</p>
      <div class="native-case-heading"><h3>The excluded tool<br />is unavailable.</h3><span class="native-status">Refused as expected</span></div>
      <dl><div><dt>Exact grant</dt><dd><code>{protectedRun.exactGrant}</code></dd></div><div><dt>Scripted requested tool</dt><dd><code>{protectedRun.excludedPatch.tool}</code></dd></div></dl>
      <p class="native-field-label">Actual runtime refusal</p>
      <pre>{protectedRun.excludedPatch.actualRuntimeRefusal}</pre>
      <p class="native-file-state"><span>Protected target file</span><strong>Absent before <Icon name="arrow-right" /> absent after</strong></p>
    </article>
    <article class="native-control" data-native-control>
      <p class="native-step">Separate fresh control thread</p>
      <div class="native-case-heading"><h3>Grant the patch tool.<br />The file is created.</h3><span class="native-status">Accepted as expected</span></div>
      <dl><div><dt>Exact grant</dt><dd><code>{separateControl.exactGrant}</code></dd></div><div><dt>Scripted operation</dt><dd>Same FREEFORM patch shape</dd></div></dl>
      <p class="native-field-label">Selected recorded result</p>
      <p class="native-control-result"><Icon name="check" /><span>Exit code {separateControl.exitCode}; file added.<strong>Expected fixture bytes matched.</strong></span></p>
      <p class="native-file-state"><span>Different owned control file</span><strong>Absent before <Icon name="arrow-right" /> present after</strong></p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <p class="native-separation">The control is a different thread. It did not widen the protected grant. Start requests differ only in the selected tool; the patch item differs only in its owned target filename.</p>
  <p class="native-gateway">These are the runtime’s native tools. <a href="/features/gateway-tool-profiles/">Gateway/MCP resource scopes and tool menus</a> are a separate boundary.</p>
  <details class="native-evidence" data-native-evidence>
    <summary>Inspect the recorded checks <Icon name="plus" /></summary>
    <div>
      <p>This is a selected projection of two saved runs, not a live terminal. A deterministic local fake Responses peer supplied every assistant message and tool-call item. No real model chose either operation; no hosted inference occurred. This page only displays saved results.</p>
      <dl class="native-provenance"><div><dt>Runtime</dt><dd>{receipt.runtime.name}, CLI {receipt.runtime.cliVersion}; policy bridge {receipt.runtime.policyBridgeVersion}</dd></div><div><dt>Source pins</dt><dd>Codex Engine <code>{receipt.runtime.engineSource}</code>; upstream <code>{receipt.runtime.upstreamTag}</code> / <code>{receipt.runtime.upstreamSource}</code></dd></div><div><dt>Catalog provenance</dt><dd>{receipt.fixtures.observedNativeToolCount} runtime-emitted native identities under synthetic model/account configuration, identical across restart and control. The model label <code>{receipt.fixtures.modelLabel}</code> is fixture metadata, not an inference claim or current account catalog.</dd></div><div><dt>Prepared artifact</dt><dd>{receipt.runtime.artifact}.</dd></div><div><dt>Operation threads</dt><dd>One protected thread with one app-server restart/resume; one separate fresh patch control, with no restart. Both configured zero MCP servers.</dd></div><div><dt>Catalog-only helper</dt><dd>The source catalog probe used an inventory-only local MCP fixture in ephemeral probe threads. It did not exercise Gateway authorization or a real MCP service.</dd></div><div><dt>Separate source checks</dt><dd>{receipt.checks.focusedOriginalSourceTestsPassed} focused original source checks passed, with zero skips. Actual native execution and resume are evidenced separately by the recorded operations above.</dd></div><div><dt>Cleanup</dt><dd>Owned processes, loopback peers and temporary runtime state were removed. Host mounts were read-only apart from task-owned fixture, evidence and state directories.</dd></div></dl>
      <p>The denied patch follows cold resume; the accepted patch starts a fresh control thread. This checks native tool identity and resume behavior. It does not establish production deployment, settings UI, account authentication, fork/child inheritance, broad shell containment or an adversarial security audit.</p>
      <a class="native-receipt-link" href="/media/native-tool-boundary/receipt.json">Read the selected public receipt <Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></a>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>
<style>
.native-boundary{padding-block:36px 44px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);scroll-margin-top:24px}.native-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:28px 56px;align-items:end}.native-intro .eyebrow{color:var(--rust);margin-bottom:14px}.native-intro h2{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,4.2vw,4.1rem);line-height:1.1}.native-intro h2 em{color:var(--forest)}.native-intro>p{max-width:490px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted)}.native-scope{font-size:13px;color:var(--forest-dark);padding-block:17px;margin-top:24px;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}.native-shell-note{padding:16px 20px;margin-block:20px 24px;background:#ebeedd;border-left:3px solid var(--forest);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8}.native-shell-note strong{margin-right:6px}.native-boundary code{font-size:.89em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.native-protected,.native-comparison{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}.native-protected>article,.native-comparison>article{min-width:0;padding:25px 28px;border:1px solid #bcc3b2;background:#fcfaf4}.native-step{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:650;color:var(--forest);margin-bottom:14px}.native-boundary h3{font:550 clamp(1.35rem,2.2vw,1.8rem)/1.25 var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.035em;margin-bottom:17px}.native-resume h3{margin-bottom:14px}.native-resume>p:not(.native-step){font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted)}.native-field-label{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:16px 0 7px}.native-command{display:block;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;font-size:13px!important;line-height:1.7}.native-boundary pre{font:13px/1.75 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:14px 0;padding:15px 16px;background:#efeee5;border-left:2px solid #a8b79a}.native-verdict{font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--forest-dark);flex-wrap:wrap}.native-verdict>span{margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted)}.native-boundary dl{margin:18px 0 0}.native-boundary dl>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-block:10px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}.native-boundary dt{color:var(--muted)}.native-boundary dd{margin:0;font-weight:550;min-width:0}.native-small{font-size:12px!important;margin-top:14px}.native-comparison{margin-top:24px}.native-comparison>.native-control{background:#ecf0e2;border-color:#a7b799}.native-case-heading{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 18px;align-items:flex-start}.native-case-heading h3{flex:1;min-width:170px;margin-bottom:8px}.native-status{font-size:11px;padding:5px 8px;border:1px solid #a7b799;border-radius:3px;color:var(--forest-dark);white-space:nowrap;margin-top:4px}.native-denied .native-status{background:#f1e9d9;border-color:#bca888;color:#594a2f}.native-comparison pre{font-size:12px;min-height:72px;margin-top:7px}.native-control-result{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:11px;min-height:72px;padding:13px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--forest-dark)}.native-control-result>span>strong{display:block;font-weight:550}.native-file-state{border-top:1px solid #b9c3ad;margin-top:17px;padding-top:14px;display:grid;gap:6px;font-size:13px}.native-file-state>span{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.native-file-state>strong{font-weight:550;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}.native-separation,.native-gateway{font-size:13px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--muted);max-width:930px;margin-top:18px}.native-gateway{margin-top:9px}.native-gateway a{text-underline-offset:3px}.native-evidence{margin-top:25px;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}.native-evidence>summary{min-height:54px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:15px 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:550;cursor:pointer}.native-evidence[open]>summary :global(.ui-icon){transform:rotate(45deg)}.native-evidence>div{padding:4px 4px 22px}.native-evidence p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--muted);max-width:940px;margin-bottom:14px}.native-evidence .native-provenance{margin:20px 0}.native-provenance>div{grid-template-columns:150px 1fr!important;gap:25px!important}.native-provenance dd{font-weight:400}.native-receipt-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:46px;font-size:14px}.native-boundary :global(.ui-icon){width:17px;height:17px;flex-shrink:0}.native-control-result :global(.ui-icon){margin-top:3px}.native-boundary :is(a,summary):focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--rust);outline-offset:4px}
@media(max-width:850px){.native-intro{gap:26px}.native-protected,.native-comparison{gap:16px}.native-protected>article,.native-comparison>article{padding:22px}.native-status{font-size:10px}.native-verdict>span{margin-left:0}.native-boundary dl>div{grid-template-columns:.9fr 1fr;gap:8px}}
@media(max-width:650px){.native-boundary{padding-block:28px 34px}.native-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:17px}.native-intro h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,8.5vw,3.1rem)}.native-intro>p{font-size:16px}.native-scope{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;margin-top:20px;padding-block:13px}.native-shell-note{padding:14px 16px;margin-block:18px;font-size:13px}.native-shell-note strong{display:block;margin-bottom:4px}.native-protected,.native-comparison{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}.native-protected>article,.native-comparison>article{padding:21px 20px}.native-boundary h3{font-size:24px}.native-comparison{margin-top:14px}.native-status{font-size:11px}.native-step{font-size:11px;margin-bottom:12px}.native-comparison pre,.native-control-result{min-height:0}.native-provenance>div{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:4px!important;padding-block:12px!important}.native-provenance dt{font-weight:550}.native-file-state>strong{font-size:13px}.native-separation{margin-top:17px}.native-evidence{margin-top:20px}.native-evidence>summary{font-size:13px}.native-evidence p{font-size:13px}}
</style>
